  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:360px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-royalblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Sadness Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b2/Lilitu.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20120324173947\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Lilitu\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b2/Lilitu.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20120324173947\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b2/Lilitu.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20120324173947 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b2/Lilitu.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20120324173947 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Lilitu\" width=\"270\" height=\"279\" data-image-key=\"Lilitu.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Lilitu.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Lilitu (Angel: Auld Lang Syne) draws strength from the sorrow of men.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb sadness.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"Its tragically delicious!\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― Androids Dungeon Customer (The Simpsons)</dd></dl></div>\n<p>The ability to <b>absorb sadness and utilize it in some way</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Melancholy_Manipulation\" title=\"Melancholy Manipulation\">Melancholy Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Emotion_Absorption\" title=\"Emotion Absorption\">Emotion Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSadness_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Melancholy Absorption/Ingestion</li>\n<li>Sadness Devouring/Theft</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSadness_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can fully or partially absorb sadness, while removing it from the source, into their body and use it in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by enhancing themselves, gaining the drained power, using it as power source etc., either temporarily or permanently. Targets of the draining become calm.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSadness_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Regeneration\" title=\"Absorbing Regeneration\">Absorbing Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Assimilation Shield\">Assimilation Shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Emotion_Metabolization\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Emotion Metabolization\">Emotion Metabolization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Condition\">Enhanced Condition</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Supernatural Condition\">Supernatural Condition</a></li>\n<li>Induce sadlessness by absorbing sadness.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a> (limited to sadness-based powers)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sadness_Empowerment\" title=\"Sadness Empowerment\">Sadness Empowerment</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSadness_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Emotion_Manipulation\" title=\"Emotion Manipulation\">Emotion Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Emotion_Negation\" title=\"Emotion Negation\">Emotion Negation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Emotional_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Emotional Energy Manipulation\">Emotional Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Emotional_Vampirism\" title=\"Emotional Vampirism\">Emotional Vampirism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Melancholy_Manipulation\" title=\"Melancholy Manipulation\">Melancholy Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSadness_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Users of <a href=\"/wiki/Emotionlessness\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Emotionlessness\">Apathy</a> or beings who lack emotion sadness are immune.</li>\n<li>May be limited to the amount of sadness the user can absorb</li>\n<li>May be psychologically affected by the sadness that is absorbed from others.</li>\n<li>May be limited to how much one can absorb.</li>\n<li>May have limited range, including touch only.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSadness_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Lilitu (<i>Angel: Auld Lang Syne</i>)</li>\n<li>Spectra (<i>Danny Phantom</i>)</li>\n<li>Bakjam/Bakugami, The Blessed Slumber Majik / The Joyous Sorrow Majik (<i>Madan no Ichi/Ichi the Witch</i>)</li>\n<li>Misery Cleaver (<i>Record of Ragnarok</i>)</li>\n<li>Zerofuku (<i>Record of Ragnarok</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSadness_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"538054b07941e2